<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我突然get到了把作者页当沙盒的好处（？</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content"><script type="text/javascript" src="http://d3g0gp89917ko0.cloudfront.net/v--3e3a6f7dbcc9/common--javascript/yahooui/tabview-min.js">
</script>
<div id="wiki-tabview-aef9f5e1a4568ace76795b09fad32da6" class="yui-navset">
<ul class="yui-nav">
<li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>cone</em></a></li>
<li><a href="javascript:;"><em>David Rosen</em></a></li>
